{"slot":"spa_for_eng:pod-1:SC21-S014","speaker":"Narrator","text":"October. November. December.","audio_id":"6c0f0f90-df4c-4b5f-966f-eff805932754","s3_key_before":"mastered/6F726382-9FAB-44CA-ACED-2DA864430734.mp3","duration_ms_before":3072,"at":"2026-08-28T00:01:26.735Z","model":"sonic-3.6","bytes_before":37440,"before":{"lufs":-16.5,"lra":20,"peak_dbfs":-1.4},"status":"measured"}
{"slot":"spa_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S002","speaker":"Friend","text":"Of course, no problem. You seem to speak it very well. I can understand you easily.","audio_id":"da23d746-7feb-4d60-91be-6f6a14a8807a","s3_key_before":"mastered/8A17B978-0495-4266-A07E-008212987C73.mp3","duration_ms_before":5592,"at":"2026-08-28T00:01:26.890Z","model":"sonic-3.6","bytes_before":67680,"before":{"lufs":-16.3,"lra":1.5,"peak_dbfs":-1.8},"status":"measured"}
{"slot":"spa_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S004","speaker":"Friend","text":"Am I speaking slowly enough for you now?","audio_id":"2bf2685f-bdca-4443-94a0-1cc2b2600e54","s3_key_before":"mastered/2969FCD7-FF65-4FB2-BB9B-3BF9C061D8BD.mp3","duration_ms_before":2472,"at":"2026-08-28T00:01:27.087Z","model":"sonic-3.6","bytes_before":30240,"before":{"lufs":-16.5,"lra":0,"peak_dbfs":-1.9},"status":"measured"}
{"slot":"spa_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S006","speaker":"Friend","text":"I think you're doing very well. I'm impressed. I think you're ready to start speaking Spanish to anyone who speaks Spanish.","audio_id":"87e1279d-f3c5-4203-9cfc-92eda49872c8","s3_key_before":"mastered/B6CB5359-DEB3-4D47-880C-CE63E3AF13B2.mp3","duration_ms_before":7584,"at":"2026-08-28T00:01:27.253Z","model":"sonic-3.6","bytes_before":91584,"before":{"lufs":-16.3,"lra":2.8,"peak_dbfs":-1.5},"status":"measured"}
{"slot":"spa_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S008","speaker":"Friend","text":"You should be confident already. I think you're doing much better than you realise. I feel comfortable speaking with you, and I'm not talking very slowly.","audio_id":"d6665613-a638-4136-8734-4edf11d0e960","s3_key_before":"mastered/4E890A90-7F89-4796-B04C-AC00D95D2FBC.mp3","duration_ms_before":7536,"at":"2026-08-28T00:01:27.451Z","model":"sonic-3.6","bytes_before":91008,"before":{"lufs":-16.3,"lra":1.9,"peak_dbfs":-1.7},"status":"measured"}
{"slot":"spa_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S010","speaker":"Friend","text":"I think that's normal. Learning a new language is difficult. But it's so much fun when you start to have conversations, isn't it?","audio_id":"714ba13e-d273-49c0-a8c4-82fef148cebf","s3_key_before":"mastered/659C50E8-A2DF-4069-BFBF-A2B28D4E5EA3.mp3","duration_ms_before":7536,"at":"2026-08-28T00:01:27.631Z","model":"sonic-3.6","bytes_before":91008,"before":{"lufs":-16.2,"lra":3.2,"peak_dbfs":-1.8},"status":"measured"}
